description "Kowakian Monkey-Lizard 

Cackling pests with nothing better to do than annoy anyone they see. Heard any good jokes lately?

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster rate of fire
- Foraged E-11 Blaster Rifle (DC Carb 1)
-- 18% more damage
-- 50% more velocity
-- 175% slower rate of fire
-- Primary fire only
- ... (12) (IHR)
-- Pulls on hit
-- 50% less damage
-- 100% smaller splash
-- Secondary fire only
- Frag Grenade (1)

^5Powers:
- Crumb Jump (1)
- Animal Instinct (Sense 1)

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcements (2)
- Stamina (2)
- Dexterity (1)
- Strength (1)
- Assemble (2)
- 50% more knockback taken
- 75% slower skill cooldown

^3Abilities:
- Toxic Laughter
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]

Turn over for nutritional information."